# armour/tiles/mail: riveted mail on the mail sleeve (U, the `mail` form; ARMOUR-X wave 2, STYLE_P2 25.2): rows of rings
# read as a lit row over a shadow row with a dark ring-gap every 4 px, the rows offset by 2 (a brick, never a checker);
# at 1x a fine woven grey, the arm's own light running through it. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h; `on-region` contracts 4.
use person
body adult
role overlay mail
tags tile overlay
on-region U

view D key rest origin 0 0
|xxxw
|wxww
|xwxx
|wwwx
